    "Every SpectrumObject field is retained: Carrier:Type_, suspension:Carrier→Carrier, homotopyGroup:ℤ→Type_, stable:Prop, its proof and label. The indexed types are not supplied as groups and have no connecting maps/equivalence or relation to Carrier.",
